# Round 10 (18 Oct): round 9 refined toward the owner's reference (official NJO-era Vong ship art): written
# descriptions only, the picture itself is never given to the model.
LOOK="living Yuuzhan Vong starships that look like grown sea creatures: fleshy mauve, lilac and dusky pink hulls with pitted, porous, barnacled skin; crab-like and crustacean warships with curved tusks, claws and rows of spines; translucent jellyfish ships with domed bells and long trailing filaments; a huge pale bulbous capital ship veined with red, tangled red tendrils hanging from it; small rough coral fighters"
P1="A wide cinematic Star Wars Legends space battle in orbit above a burning city-covered planet. A fleet of $LOOK, hurling glowing magma and throwing small black gravity voids that swallow laser fire. In the foreground the New Republic fleet is torn apart: a grey wedge-shaped Star Destroyer breaking in half and exploding, a blue starfighter banking past firing red lasers, burning wreckage and escape pods. Craggy brown asteroids drift through the scene. Deep blue starfield, orange fire, soft glowing light. Painted illustration in the airbrushed style of 1990s and 2000s Star Wars novel cover art, rich saturated colours. The bottom third is darker and calmer. No text, no logos."
P2="A wide painted Star Wars Legends scene: an invasion fleet of $LOOK, moving through a field of craggy brown asteroids towards a distant planet. Between the rocks a battered New Republic fleet fights back and dies: grey wedge-shaped Star Destroyers exploding in fireballs, X-wing starfighters firing red lasers, burning debris. Deep blue space with a bright star behind the fleet. Airbrushed style of 1990s and 2000s Star Wars novel cover art, rich saturated colours, soft glow. The bottom third is darker and calmer. No text, no logos."
P3="A wide painted Star Wars Legends scene: the orbital bombardment of a planet-wide city at dusk. Descending through towering smoke, $LOOK, raining glowing magma onto endless skyscrapers that collapse into molten craters and rivers of fire. A shattered moon breaks apart in the sky. A grey wedge-shaped Star Destroyer falls in flames; X-wings fire red lasers. Airbrushed style of 1990s and 2000s Star Wars novel cover art, purple and orange sky, rich saturated colours. The bottom third is darker and calmer. No text, no logos."
